-+	  architectures which transition to low power states when only
-+	  the "master" CPU is online, or for thermally constrained
-+	  devices.
-+
-+	  If you don't have one of these architectures or devices, use
-+	  'ondemand' instead.
-+
-+	  If in doubt, say N.
